From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 12:08:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/core: use damos_quota_is_set() in
 damos_adjust_quota()

damos_adjust_quota() is doing manual quota setup check.  There is a
dedicated helper for the purpose, damos_quota_is_set().  Use the helper.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/core.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/core.c b/mm/damon/core.c
index 6e071dc432f9b..5fdb5922edb78 100644
--- a/mm/damon/core.c
+++ b/mm/damon/core.c
@@ -3543,7 +3543,7 @@ static void damos_adjust_quota(struct damon_ctx *c, struct damos *s)
 	unsigned long cumulated_sz, cached_esz;
 	unsigned int score, max_score = 0;
 
-	if (!quota->ms && !quota->sz && list_empty(&quota->goals))
+	if (!damos_quota_is_set(quota))
 		return;
 
 	/* First charge window */
-- 
2.47.3

